3. Since it’s a Ruby-on-Rails app, APIs with robust RESTful interfaces and good Ruby SDKs or clear HTTP interface are preferred. Twilio, SendGrid, Mandrill, Mailjet, Mesibo, QuickBlox, Pusher, Slack have official or community Ruby client libraries.  

