Given the focus on scientific and research papers, Mendeley API is a strong candidate as it is dedicated to scholarly research. PLoS Search API provides access to scientific literature. Open Library is helpful for general book metadata. DBpedia Spotlight can extract and link named entities in the selected text, helping to refine queries. Altmetric API can access discussions around scientific papers, useful for researchers. NLP and text similarity APIs can enhance relevance.

