The best practice:
- Use twitter-streaming API to get real-time tweets with keyword 'obesity'.
- Extract geo location from tweets when available.
- If geo coordinates are not directly available, use user location field and apply a geocoding service like google-maps-geocoding or bing-maps-geocode-dataflow to convert address or place strings to geographic coordinates.
- Finally, plot those geo-coordinates on Google Maps (using Google Maps APIs).

